n```\n\n按关键词找（例如勾股定理相关）：\n\n```bash\ngrep -i 'pythagorean' references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,2,5\n```\n\n`requirement` 字段里含逗号，所以取整行文本时用 `grep` 原样输出，别用 `cut` 切到第 5 列以后。\n\n## 回答约定\n\n- 引用课标要求时给出**原文**（英文）加编号，必要时再翻译。\n- 一并给出 `grade` / `domain` 和 `pdf_page`，方便回到 PDF 核对。\n- 表里没有的条目直说没有，不要照编号规律臆造。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1788751505102},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to query grade 5 fractions standards. Let me use the awk command to filter grade 5 and fractions domain. The skill says to resolve relative paths against the skill directory: /Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards/\n\nLet me first check the index.md overview and query the CSV. I can do both in parallel.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_66fd431c496f46b98f611691","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"grep -i '5' /Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards/references/index.md | head -20"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4ccb397c9aba44c2884acb69","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"awk -F',' '$2==\"5\" && $3==\"Fractions\"' /Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards/references/standards.csv"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"ark-plan","model":"glm-5.3","usage":{"input":608,"output":203,"cacheRead":2240,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":3051,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0},"cacheWrite1h":0},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788751505107,"responseId":"02178875150519491be90b70b1bfc3059428bd07e108b7eb4993b","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_66fd431c496f46b98f611691","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"共 385 条，来自 数学课标整理表格.xlsx。全量数据在 `standards.csv`（列：code, grade, domain, cluster, requirement, pdf_page）。\n| K | Operations and Algebraic Thinking | 5 | K